[
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art9/p1#1@2023-07-01",”review_in_scope”:”unclear”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:3,”review_proposal_alignment”:2,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:null,”review_comment”:”The regulation says the entity "შეუძლია" (may) outsource, and the duty is to follow outsourcing principles when it does. The document never mentions outsourcing, so the gap is real, but the obligation should have been framed as conditional. The duty belongs in the operational-risk/model-risk policy more than an ethics guideline, and “new_document” is an oversized fix for one sentence.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art9/p3#1@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”no”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”minor”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”Proposal heading ‘3.5.1’ is invented. The proposal merely repeats the regulation without defining what a stricter standard means.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”not_applicable”,”review_verdict_correct”:”partly”,”review_error_type”:”not_in_scope”,”review_argument_quality”: 2,”review_proposal_alignment”: 2,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The regulation says third-party model risk management "უნდა ექვემდებარებოდეს უფრო მკაცრ სტანდარტებს", a general risk-management duty with no ethics content. An ethics guideline need not carry it, so absence is not a real gap. If forced to choose, the document is silent, so “none” would be the literal verdict.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art9_1/p4#2@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”major”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”Claims the document contains no monitoring or elimination of bias; actually §4.1/§4.2 and §7 touch bias, though only as a banned-variable list. Also says the document is only about ethical principles, which is false for a duty that sits squarely in art. 9¹ (ethics).”,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:2,”review_proposal_alignment”:3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:3,”review_comment”:”The document has no monitoring of identifiable bias in data processing; the validators only check the variable list against §4.1 ("ვალიდაციისას ცვლადების სიის შემოწმება"). The verdict matches, but the rationale wrongly treats the topic as out of scope for an ethics document, and no evidence clause is cited. Gold concerns a broader set (proxy variables §4.2, accuracy as primary goal §3.2), of which this finding captures only the monitoring gap.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art3/p2#2@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”no”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”no”,”review_hallucination”:”minor”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”The obligation drops the “all model types” element yet the rationale then claims it as missing. The second evidence item cites ‘§—’, a non-existent section number. The document does not claim to be the internal policy, so ‘partial’ compliance is overstated.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”not_applicable”,”review_verdict_correct”:”partly”,”review_error_type”:”not_in_scope”,”review_argument_quality”: 2,”review_proposal_alignment”: 2,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The regulation addresses "შიდა პოლიტიკა-პროცედურები" (the bank’s internal policies and procedures), which here is POL-RM-014, referenced in §1.1; an ethics guideline is not that document. Citing §1.1 and the role table as partial coverage is a stretch, and the proposal puts a duty about ‘internal policies’ into the guideline’s purpose clause.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art4/p3#1@2023-07-01",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”partial”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:5,”review_proposal_alignment”:4,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:5,”review_comment”:”§2 cites „2018 წლის 9 ივლისის №154/04 ბრძანებით დამტკიცებული ეთიკის პრინციპებისა და პროფესიული ქცევის სტანდარტების კოდექსი“, whereas the regulation requires the 2021 №13/04 code; this quote exists and the facts are right. Proposal swaps the reference to №13/04, matching the gold fix, but drops the old code without justification; and the first half of the duty (developing own ethics principles) is met by the document itself.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art5/p1#1@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”minor”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”Evidence cites ‘§—’ instead of §7; the claim is only about terminology, not substance.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”partial”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”: 3,”review_proposal_alignment”: 3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The §7 table gives „მოდელის შემმუშავებელი“ only variable-selection duties and documentation; nowhere is responsibility for model building and testing assigned to the first line of defence. The gap is a missing assignment, not just missing terminology, although the proposal adds the first-line wording and building/testing duty.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art6/p4.1#11@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”no”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”major”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”Evidence quote is empty (““”) with section ‘§—’, so no clause is actually cited. The claim that the document already requires variable documentation as a partial match is stretched: variable-list documentation (§7) is not ‘model documentation’ as a risk factor. The proposal gives developers a task the regulation assigns to the ranking methodology.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”not_applicable”,”review_verdict_correct”:”no”,”review_error_type”:”not_in_scope”,”review_argument_quality”:1,”review_proposal_alignment”:1,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:null,”review_comment”:”The regulation item „მოდელთან დაკავშირებული დოკუმენტაცია“ is a single factor in the model risk ranking methodology (art. 6 ¶4¹ ბ.დ), which cannot be assessed on its own and is not an ethics-guideline matter. Partial is not defensible when no clause is cited; the right result is no finding (a gap, if any, is already covered by Finding 5).”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art6/p6#2@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”no”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”major”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”Evidence quote is empty and section ‘§—’; says the document ‘mentions’ the validation group’s responsibility but that is a different duty (variable-list check), unrelated to proportionality.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”not_applicable”,”review_verdict_correct”:”no”,”review_error_type”:”not_in_scope”,”review_argument_quality”: 1,”review_proposal_alignment”: 1,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The duty „იყენებს პროპორციულობის პრინციპს მოდელის მნიშვნელობიდან და სირთულიდან გამომდინარე“ concerns the conduct of the second line’s validation, a matter for the model-risk policy rather than an ethics guideline. The document’s validation-group row concerns only a check against §4.1, so ‘partial’ is not supported; at most the document is silent. The proposal forces a proportionality duty into an unrelated role row.”
    }
]